<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
        <title>{% block title %}Administration{% endblock %} — Billetterie</title>
        <style>
            :root {
                --bg: #f4f6f9;
                --surface: #ffffff;
                --text: #1f2937;
                --muted: #5b6675;
                --line: #dfe4ea;
                --primary: #1d4ed8;
                --primary-dark: #1e3a8a;
                --success-bg: #dcfce7;
                --success-text: #166534;
                --warning-bg: #fef3c7;
                --warning-text: #92400e;
                --danger-bg: #fee2e2;
                --danger-text: #991b1b;
                --neutral-bg: #e5e7eb;
                --neutral-text: #374151;
                --info-bg: #dbeafe;
                --info-text: #1e40af;
            }

            * { box-sizing: border-box; }

            body {
                margin: 0;
                background: var(--bg);
                color: var(--text);
                font: 15px/1.5 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
            }

            a { color: var(--primary); text-decoration: none; }
            a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

            .container { width: min(1200px, 100% - 2rem); margin-inline: auto; }

            .topbar { background: #111827; color: #f9fafb; }
            .topbar-inner { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; align-items: center; padding: 1rem 0; }
            .brand { color: #f9fafb; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; }
            .brand span { color: #93c5fd; font-weight: 500; }
            .topnav { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .35rem; margin-left: auto; }
            .topnav a { color: #e5e7eb; padding: .35rem .6rem; border-radius: .35rem; font-size: .9rem; }
            .topnav a:hover, .topnav a[aria-current="page"] { background: #1f2937; text-decoration: none; }

            .notice {
                background: #fffbeb;
                border-bottom: 1px solid #fcd34d;
                color: #92400e;
                font-size: .88rem;
                padding: .55rem 0;
            }

            main { padding: 1.5rem 0 2.5rem; min-height: 65vh; }
            .page-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
            .page-head h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.55rem; }
            .page-head p { margin: .25rem 0 0; color: var(--muted); }

            .card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: .7rem; padding: 1rem; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgb(15 23 42 / .04); }
            .grid { display: grid; gap: 1rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(190px, 1fr)); }
            .stat { display: block; color: inherit; }
            .stat:hover { text-decoration: none; border-color: #93c5fd; }
            .stat strong { display: block; font-size: 1.7rem; margin-top: .25rem; }
            .stat span { color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }
            .stat .hint { display: block; margin-top: .4rem; font-size: .82rem; }

            .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: .7rem; }
            table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; min-width: 720px; }
            th, td { padding: .7rem .8rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
            th { background: #f8fafc; font-size: .8rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .03em; color: var(--muted); }
            tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
            tbody tr:hover { background: #f8fbff; }
            td small, .muted { color: var(--muted); }

            .badge { display: inline-block; padding: .15rem .5rem; border-radius: 999px; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }
            .badge-disponible, .badge-payee, .badge-valide, .badge-programmee, .badge-actif { background: var(--success-bg); color: var(--success-text); }
            .badge-reservee, .badge-en_attente { background: var(--warning-bg); color: var(--warning-text); }
            .badge-vendue, .badge-annulee, .badge-annule, .badge-echouee, .badge-expiree, .badge-inactif { background: var(--danger-bg); color: var(--danger-text); }
            .badge-bloquee, .badge-terminee { background: var(--neutral-bg); color: var(--neutral-text); }

            .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .4rem; align-items: center; }
            .btn { display: inline-block; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: .4rem; padding: .45rem .7rem; font: inherit; font-size: .9rem; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; }
            .btn:hover { text-decoration: none; }
            .btn-primary { background: var(--primary); color: #fff; }
            .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--primary-dark); }
            .btn-secondary { background: #fff; color: var(--text); border-color: var(--line); }
            .btn-danger { background: #b91c1c; color: #fff; }
            .btn-small { padding: .28rem .55rem; font-size: .82rem; }

            .filters { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .75rem; align-items: end; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding: .9rem; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: .7rem; }
            .filters .field { min-width: 150px; flex: 1 1 150px; }
            .filters .field-wide { flex: 2 1 260px; }

            .field { margin-bottom: .9rem; }
            .field label, .filters label { display: block; font-weight: 600; font-size: .88rem; margin-bottom: .3rem; }
            .field input, .field select, .field textarea, .filters input, .filters select {
                width: 100%;
                padding: .5rem .6rem;
                border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
                border-radius: .4rem;
                background: #fff;
                font: inherit;
                color: var(--text);
            }
            .field textarea { resize: vertical; }
            .field input:disabled, .field select:disabled { background: #f1f5f9; color: var(--muted); }
            .help { display: block; margin-top: .3rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: .82rem; }
            .errors, .form-error { color: var(--danger-text); font-size: .86rem; margin: .3rem 0 0; padding-left: 1rem; }
            .form-grid { display: grid; gap: 1rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); }
            .form-card { max-width: 760px; }

            .flash { padding: .7rem .9rem; border-radius: .5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; border: 1px solid transparent; }
            .flash-success { background: var(--success-bg); color: var(--success-text); border-color: #86efac; }
            .flash-error { background: var(--danger-bg); color: var(--danger-text); border-color: #fca5a5; }
            .flash-info { background: var(--info-bg); color: var(--info-text); border-color: #93c5fd; }

            .pagination { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .75rem; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-top: 1rem; font-size: .9rem; }
            .pagination a { padding: .35rem .6rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: .35rem; background: #fff; }

            .detail-list { display: grid; gap: .6rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); }
            .detail-list dt { color: var(--muted); font-size: .82rem; }
            .detail-list dd { margin: .1rem 0 0; font-weight: 600; }

            .footer { color: var(--muted); font-size: .82rem; padding-bottom: 2rem; }
            .empty { color: var(--muted); padding: 1.2rem; text-align: center; }

            @media (max-width: 640px) {
                .topnav { margin-left: 0; }
                .page-head { align-items: start; }
                table { min-width: 620px; }
                .actions { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <header class="topbar">
            <div class="container topbar-inner">
                <a class="brand" href="{{ path('admin_index') }}">Billetterie <span>Administration</span></a>
                <nav class="topnav" aria-label="Navigation principale">
                    {% set currentRoute = app.request.attributes.get('_route') %}
                    <a href="{{ path('admin_index') }}" {% if currentRoute == 'admin_index' %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}>Tableau de bord</a>
                    <a href="{{ path('admin_salle_index') }}" {% if currentRoute starts with 'admin_salle_' %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}>Salles</a>
                    <a href="{{ path('admin_evenement_index') }}" {% if currentRoute starts with 'admin_evenement_' %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}>Événements</a>
                    <a href="{{ path('admin_representation_index') }}" {% if currentRoute starts with 'admin_representation_' %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}>Représentations</a>
                    <a href="{{ path('admin_tarif_index') }}" {% if currentRoute starts with 'admin_tarif_' %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}>Tarifs</a>
                    <a href="{{ path('admin_inventaire_index') }}" {% if currentRoute starts with 'admin_inventaire_' %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}>Inventaire</a>
                    <a href="{{ path('admin_commande_index') }}" {% if currentRoute starts with 'admin_commande_' %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}>Commandes</a>
                    <a href="{{ path('admin_billet_index') }}" {% if currentRoute starts with 'admin_billet_' %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}>Billets</a>
                </nav>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="notice">
            <div class="container">Back-office local de démonstration — authentification et rôles non activés (Niveau 3). Ne pas exposer publiquement.</div>
        </div>

        <main class="container">
            {% for label, messages in app.flashes %}
                {% for message in messages %}
                    <div class="flash flash-{{ label }}" role="status">{{ message }}</div>
                {% endfor %}
            {% endfor %}

            {% block body %}{% endblock %}
        </main>

        <footer class="container footer">
            Dates affichées en Africa/Casablanca · Montants en MAD (stockés en centimes) · Plan physique en consultation seule.
        </footer>
    </body>
</html>
